            "LUMA_VIEWER_STATE": "text-tel",
            "LUMA_VIEWER_SELECTED": "receipt",
            "LUMA_VIEWER_MODE": "view"
          }
        }
      ],
      "about": "Desktop detected-text menu; at 390px the kit opens the same actions in its phone drawer. Capture assertions check each action and Copy."
